  "details": "1. Open VRChat\n\n2. Load a test world with an AVPro player with a URL of a low latency HLS stream\n\n3. Video stream will not instantly start on PC (takes time to load)\n\n4. Video stream will have a ~35 second delay from the source stream\n\nThe HLS stream I have been testing with is https://live.stream.starcollection.mu:8888/stream/test/index.m3u8\n\nI have tested the HLS loading and latency across multiple devices available to me, the results are:\n\n- PC:\n\n-- Loading = Long Delay\n\n-- Latency = ~35 second delay\n\n- Quest 3:\n\n-- Loading = Instant\n\n-- Latency = ~3 seconds\n\n- iOS:\n\n-- Loading = Instant\n\n-- Latency = ~2 seconds\n\n- Android\n\n-- Loading = Instant\n\n-- Latency = ~1 second\n\nI have attached an image showing photos from all 4 platforms, with the time on the stream added by OBS and the time above being the local time using a clock asset.\n\nPlease can you investigate the cause of both the long loading time on PC (other platforms display the video instantly) and the large delay/latency on the PC compared to the other platforms.\n\nThe same world was used to test all devices, no changes was made between tests.\n\nAs a note the AVPro player component had Low Latency enabled\n\nI have tested this on 2 different PCs and the result was the same.",
